      "message": "* **Incomplete USB Cleanup:** In `openDevice`, you detach the kernel driver and claim the interface using `libusb_detach_kernel_driver` and `libusb_claim_interface`. However, in your cleanup routine (`releaseResource` / `LibusbDeviceHandleDeleter`), you only call `libusb_close()`.  \n    \n  * *Remediation:* It is best practice to explicitly call `libusb_release_interface()` before closing the device. Additionally, if you detached a kernel driver, you should attempt to reattach it using `libusb_attach_kernel_driver()` before closing so the OS can resume normal interaction with the device.",
